 → 数据与存储 → 「使用应用私有目录（鸿蒙推荐）」；代价是卸载应用时会一并删除。\n\n## 校验 (SHA-256)\n\n```\n71d47c58de83233c452c31b437547ad357f43c1dd9fe4e504d8cde79d56f2cee  Anikku-v0.2.0-harmony-preview.5-arm64-v8a.apk\nb636a1de82e31c8dee1bbdea3f8716e644a41e4481306a043be5c8af9d4e8315  Anikku-v0.2.0-harmony-preview.5.apk\n```\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xun2202/anikku-harmony/releases/404607907","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xun2202/anikku-harmony/releases/404607907/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Xun2202/anikku-harmony/releases/404607907/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Xun2202/anikku-harmony/releases/tag/v0.2.0-harmony-preview.4","id":404607907,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOU9D-tM4YHdOj","tag_name":"v0.2.0-harmony-preview.4","target_commitish":"45a87303df89e01148fc79ed2ea51af1723783ae","name":"Anikku Harmony Preview v0.2.0-harmony-preview.4","draft":false,